eq11.para:
$$
V = -\left(\frac{\text{he} - \text{hef}_1}{\text{TR}}\right) 50 + \text{he} \ ; \quad \text{TR} > 50\%
$$

$$
V = -\left(\frac{\text{hef}_1}{80 - \text{TR}}\right) 50 + \text{hef}_1 + \left(\frac{\text{hef}_1}{80 - \text{TR}}\right) \text{TR} \ ; \quad \text{TR} \le 50\%
$$

$$
T_i = -\left(\frac{\text{hef}_{i-1} + \text{HR}_{i-1}}{80}\right) 50 + \text{hef}_{i-1} + \text{HR}_{i-1} \ ; \quad i = 2 \text{ e } 3
$$

$$
